 *
 * File Structure:
 * - Props: project pages
 * - Card with figure, title, and one line
 *
 * Where this file is used within the repository:
 * - src/pages/index.astro and src/pages/projects.astro
 *
 * Usage:
 * $ `npm run dev` : Renders in the local development server
